WEBVTT

01:04:58.871 --> 01:05:02.621
I would pick like communication
skills or evangelism

01:05:02.621 --> 01:05:04.288
or something in that direction as well.

01:05:04.746 --> 01:05:07.621
There are all of the obvious ones
that matter, like intelligence,

01:05:07.621 --> 01:05:09.454
but there's like a lot of smart
people in the world.

01:05:09.829 --> 01:05:11.204
And when I look back at kind of

01:05:11.204 --> 01:05:13.204
the thousands of entrepreneurs
I've worked with,

01:05:13.496 --> 01:05:15.788
all of many of whom were
like quite capable,

01:05:16.079 --> 01:05:17.704
I would say that's like one and two of

01:05:17.704 --> 01:05:20.038
the surprisingly differentiated
characteristics.

01:05:20.288 --> 01:05:22.496
What it's it's what I look at,

01:05:22.496 --> 01:05:24.663
the different things that you've
built and you're working on.

01:05:24.663 --> 01:05:29.288
I mean, it could not be more foundational
for the future. I mean, entrepreneurship.

01:05:29.579 --> 01:05:35.413
I know this is I agree that this is
really what has driven the future.